      "html": "<div class=\"slot\"><svg class=\"shirt\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 112\" width=\"72\" height=\"81\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M27 4H39Q50 12 61 4H73C74 21 82 31 93 33L91 108H9L7 33C18 31 26 21 27 4Z\" fill=\"#c8102e\"/><path d=\"M39 4Q50 12 61 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f4f4f1\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"/><path d=\"M73 4C74 21 82 31 93 33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f4f4f1\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"/><path d=\"M27 4C26 21 18 31 7 33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f4f4f1\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"/><path d=\"M9 104.5H91\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f4f4f1\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"/><path class=\"shirt-edge\" d=\"M27 4H39Q50 12 61 4H73C74 21 82 31 93 33L91 108H9L7 33C18 31 26 21 27 4Z\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"37\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.6\" font-weight=\"650\" letter-spacing=\"0.4\" fill=\"#fcfcfb\">VEZENKOV</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"40\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fcfcfb\">14</text></svg><span class=\"tag\"><span class=\"who\"><span class=\"rk\">1</span>Sasha Vezenkov</span><span class=\"meta\">OLY · 2025-26</span><span class=\"big\">19.0<small>PTS</small></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"on\"><small>PTS</small>19.0</span><span><small>REB</small>6.4</span><span><small>AST</small>1.3</span><span><small>TS%</small>66.9</span><span><small>PIR</small>22.1</span></span></span></div>",
      "css": ":host{--ink:#111110;--paper:#f9f9f7;--surface:#fcfcfb;--rule:#e1e0d9;--rule-strong:#c3c2b7;--soft:#52514e;--muted:#6d6b66;--blue:#2a78d6;font-family:'Geist Variable','Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);display:block;padding:16px}.shirt-edge{stroke:var(--rule-strong);stroke-width:1.2}svg text{font-family:inherit}:host{background:var(--surface)}.slot{display:grid;justify-items:center;width:170px}.tag{display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:1px;padding:2px 6px 3px}.who{font-weight:600;font-size:14px}.rk{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;margin-right:5px}.meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.big{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.big small{margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}.line{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.line>span{display:grid;justify-items:center}.line small{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.line .on{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Head-to-head row",
      "kind": "table",
      "description": "Compare: one measure across the players; each cell has fixed slots (value right-aligned, place in muted text) so figures line up; the leader's blue dot hugs its value in semibold ink.",
      "html": "<table><tr><th>PTS</th><td class=\"lead\"><span class=\"cell\"><span class=\"v\"><i></i>20.1</span><small>1st</small></span></td><td><span class=\"cell\"><span class=\"v\">18.2</span><small>3rd</small></span></td><td><span class=\"cell\"><span class=\"v\">7.6</span><small>5th</small></span></td></tr><tr><th>3P%</th><td><span class=\"cell\"><span class=\"v\">39.2</span><small>2nd</small></span></td><td class=\"muted\"><span class=\"cell\"><span class=\"v\">0.0</span><small></small></span></td><td class=\"lead\"><span class=\"cell\"><span class=\"v\"><i></i>46.0</span><small>1st</small></span></td></tr></table>",
      "css": ":host{--ink:#111110;--paper:#f9f9f7;--surface:#fcfcfb;--rule:#e1e0d9;--rule-strong:#c3c2b7;--soft:#52514e;--muted:#6d6b66;--blue:#2a78d6;font-family:'Geist Variable','Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);display:block;padding:16px}.shirt-edge{stroke:var(--rule-strong);stroke-width:1.2}svg text{font-family:inherit}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th{text-align:left;font-weight:500;width:5rem}td,th{padding:8px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}td{text-align:center}.cell{display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:3.75rem 1.95rem;column-gap:6px;align-items:baseline}.v{text-align:right}td small{text-align:left;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}td.lead{font-weight:600}td.muted{color:var(--muted)}i{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);margin-right:6px;vertical-align:.05em}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mirror staff",
      "kind": "chart",
      "description": "Shot twins (player page): a butterfly on a centre staff of court zones; his share grows left in Model Blue, the chosen twin's right in Baseline Gray, figures at the bar ends, axis hairlines at the staff edges; no track.",
      "html": "<table><tr><th class=\"who l\">Vezenkov <i class=\"sw him\"></i></th><th></th><th class=\"who r\"><i class=\"sw twin\"></i> Nwora</th></tr><tr><td class=\"l\"><span>33%</span><i class=\"b him\" style=\"width:53%\"></i></td><th>At the rim</th><td class=\"r\"><i class=\"b twin\" style=\"width:34%\"></i><span>21%</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"l\"><span>11%</span><i class=\"b him\" style=\"width:18%\"></i></td><th>Short, middle</th><td class=\"r\"><i class=\"b twin\" style=\"width:18%\"></i><span>11%</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"l\"><span>18%</span><i class=\"b him\" style=\"width:29%\"></i></td><th>Above the break</th><td class=\"r\"><i class=\"b twin\" style=\"width:40%\"></i><span>25%</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"l\"><span>10%</span><i class=\"b him\" style=\"width:16%\"></i></td><th>Deep three</th><td class=\"r\"><i class=\"b twin\" style=\"width:16%\"></i><span>10%</span></td></tr></table>",
      "css": ":host{--ink:#111110;--paper:#f9f9f7;--axis:#898781;--soft:#52514e;--blue:#2a78d6;--gray:#8f8d86;font-family:'Geist Variable','Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);display:block;padding:16px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}th{font-weight:500;color:var(--soft);width:8.5rem;height:26px}th.who{width:auto;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;padding-bottom:10px}th.who.l{text-align:right}th.who.r{text-align:left}td{height:26px;white-space:nowrap}td.l{text-align:right;box-shadow:inset -1px 0 0 var(--axis)}td.r{box-shadow:inset 1px 0 0 var(--axis)}.b{display:inline-block;height:10px;vertical-align:middle}.b.him{background:var(--blue);border-radius:4px 0 0 4px}.b.twin{background:var(--gray);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}td span{display:inline-block;padding:0 6px;vertical-align:middle}.sw{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px}.sw.him{background:var(--blue)}.sw.twin{background:var(--gray)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Quiet Reference",
    "overview": "EuroHoops reads like a well-kept reference work for EuroLeague numbers: neutral paper, one typeface, hairline rules, and colour that appears only where there is data. It sits alongside boxscorelab and databallr rather than trying to look like a basketball object; the owner rejected every themed metaphor (clipboard, station board, match tickets, terminals), so nothing on the page imitates a physical thing.\n\nDensity is that of a stats product, not a landing page: tables with many rows, tabular figures in every column, charts with precise hover tooltips. Controls are drawn in ink, not colour, so the one blue on screen always means \"the model\". Motion is scarce and only ever reports a change of data.\n\nLight and dark are equal citizens. The page follows the visitor's system setting, and a remembered toggle overrides it both ways.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Neutral paper and near-black night, never cream, never pure white or black.",
      "One family, Geist, carries everything from the headline to axis ticks.",
      "Hairlines separate; nothing is a card.",
      "Colour lives in data marks only; text always wears ink tokens.",
      "Tabular figures wherever numbers stack."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Colour-Is-Data Rule",
        "body": "Blue, gray and red appear only on data marks (bars, lines, dots, stems, outcome icons and their washes). Controls, links and headings are ink.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Ink Text Rule",
        "body": "Text never wears a data colour. A value beside a blue dot is set in ink; identity comes from the mark beside it.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Validated Order Rule",
        "body": "Chart colours come from the validated order (blue, then gray, then red) and are re-checked with the dataviz validator against both surfaces before any new series joins them. A fourth series folds into \"Other\" or small multiples.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Rule",
        "body": "Every column of numbers, axis tick and tooltip uses tabular figures. Standalone large numbers may stay proportional.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No-Eyebrow Rule",
        "body": "A heading carries its own weight. No small uppercase label above it, ever.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Page Rule",
        "body": "Nothing that sits in the page flow casts a shadow or is boxed as a card.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep every forecast beside the home-win baseline wherever a metric appears.",
      "**Do** carry outcome with an icon and a word as well as colour (\"Hit\", \"Miss\", \"Not scored\").",
      "**Do** animate only a change of data: bars growing from even odds, panels fading in after a competition switch (200ms), ranked dots sliding when the measure changes. Everything collapses to instant under reduced motion.",
      "**Do** gate hover effects behind a fine-pointer media query."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** add team logos, player photos or club colours; none are licensed.",
      "**Don't** present odds, stakes or \"picks\"; this is a model benchmark, not betting advice.",
      "**Don't** reintroduce a themed metaphor (clipboard, board, ticket, terminal) or a handwriting face.",
      "**Don't** put a filled background track behind a bar or rating rail.",
      "**Don't** colour text with a data colour, or use green for success; blue and red are the only outcome inks."
    ]
  }
}
